{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/Laundry_ghost.gif?t=1744417601\" />Tales of the Forgotten is a first-person walking simulator horror game with PSX-style graphics. Experience a collection of three short stories about ghosts that haunt everyday locations. Jump scares and creepy moments lurk around every corner. Each story has multiple endings to unlock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The total playthrough time is 45-60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story 1: Mirror, Mirror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/MM2.gif?t=1744417601\" />You\u2019ve just purchased your first house, and you can\u2019t wait to settle in. Unfortunately, an unwelcome presence is turning your dream home into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/MM.gif?t=1744417601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story 2: Laundry Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/LN.gif?t=1744417601\" />It\u2019s late at night and you\u2019re washing your clothes in a laundromat alone. Or at least, you think you\u2019re alone, until you suddenly become aware of a ghost who is asking for your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/Laundry_dryer.gif?t=1744417601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story 3: Unfinished Business</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/UB2.gif?t=1744417601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're working the night shift as a janitor in a seemingly empty sales office. As the night continues, it becomes clear that multiple ghostly presences have joined you for the evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/UB.gif?t=1744417601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157310/extras/endings.gif?t=1744417601\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the three stories has multiple endings to explore and unlock.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Little Peckish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157310/10f953ff2992b9bbf53162ccbf6fd7ce43214616.jpg"},{"name":"Break the Glass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157310/7904ad7b0804c6a5ef55159a85778b1446a9ece8.jpg"},{"name":"Now You're Mine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157310/e2c8fcfe63b3ab0064213000bd7f031335e4c3bc.jpg"},{"name":"Mystery Solved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157310/c56da6c0c17677e951862564e399f5b12284cde5.jpg"},{"name":"Coward","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157310/6672add70a5e923b3e5b43a152d3153a9a9a4bf4.jpg"},{"name":"Take Him Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157310/9bb85eabc069f234ca8dfe6b4d0e37c7f92ffc54.jpg"},{"name":"Pathetic...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157310/9cd87bf3cfdd6c824b510d388b17c5708c3ce6b9.jpg"},{"name":"Tales of the Forgotten","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157310/91f9702ac94ac8db7582eae094b8fddbbb997010.jpg"},{"name":"Do Your Research","path